# What never goes into the repository (decisions P-034 and P-069): the code is published, the data are not.
# R/96_git_prepare.R (menu option 19) checks the same rules a second time before every commit.

# Everything downloaded, the database and everything built from them
data/
reports/

# One table transcribed by hand from a published report (the Barcelona survey): data of a source, kept out
data_seed/

# The Spanish version that the English one replaced
_old_spanish/

# R and RStudio: the state of a session or of a computer, never of the project
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
.Rprofile
.env

# Data by its kind, wherever it is: a database, a map layer, an R object, a workbook, an archive, a document
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.gpkg
*.rds
*.rda
*.RData
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.zip
*.7z
*.gz
*.pdf

